THIRD-PARTY SERVICES

This software integrates with Google Gemini API.
Users must comply with Google's Gemini API Terms of Service:
https://ai.google.dev/terms

API keys are provided by the end user and are never collected or stored
by the developer of this software.

---

PRIVACY

Thinkora Bot stores all data (chat history, memories, preferences, reminders)
exclusively on the user's local device. No personal data is collected,
transmitted, or stored on any external server by the developer.
